rustler 0.38.0 for wasm32-wasip1: the NIF library in WebAssembly of
docs/NIFS.md. rustler finds the enif_* functions with dlsym() at run
time. In WebAssembly, there is no dlsym(): this change declares each
function as an import of the module "env" and fills the table of rustler
with them. It is not in rustler yet.

Apply it in a clone of rusterlium/rustler (the directory rustler/ of
that repository), or in a copy of the crate rustler 0.38.0 with
Cargo.toml.orig as Cargo.toml:

    git apply patches/rustler/0001-wasm32-imports.patch

